<!-- 기능: 가장자리 도크 창(왼쪽 또는 오른쪽). 바탕은 완전 투명(알파 0)이라 패널·손잡이·알약이 없는 곳은 클릭이 엑셀로 지나간다. -->
<!-- 사용법: DockWindow.xaml.cs. 오른쪽 도크에만 맨 위 알약(훈수꾼 손잡이, 우클릭 메뉴)이 있다. 색과 크기는 Theme에서. -->
<Window x:Class="ClockOut.Hunsu.Overlay.DockWindow"
        xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        Title="훈수꾼 도크" Width="264" Height="560"
        WindowStyle="None" AllowsTransparency="True" Background="Transparent"
        ShowInTaskbar="False" ShowActivated="False" ResizeMode="NoResize"
        FontFamily="{StaticResource Hunsu.Font}" FontSize="{StaticResource Hunsu.FontBody}"
        TextOptions.TextFormattingMode="Display">
  <Grid x:Name="Root" Background="Transparent">
    <StackPanel x:Name="Column" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="{StaticResource Hunsu.ShadowMargin}">
      <Border x:Name="Pill" HorizontalAlignment="Right" CornerRadius="{StaticResource Hunsu.PillRadius}" Margin="0,0,0,8"
              Background="{StaticResource Hunsu.Glass}" BorderBrush="{StaticResource Hunsu.Line}" BorderThickness="1"
              Padding="4,3,12,3" Cursor="Hand" Effect="{StaticResource Hunsu.Shadow1}" MouseLeftButtonUp="Pill_MouseLeftButtonUp">
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
          <Border Width="22" Height="22" CornerRadius="11" Background="{StaticResource Hunsu.Accent}">
            <TextBlock Text="훈" FontWeight="Bold" FontSize="{StaticResource Hunsu.FontSmall}" Foreground="{StaticResource Hunsu.AccentInk}"
                       HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
          </Border>
          <TextBlock x:Name="PillText" Text="훈수꾼" Margin="8,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Foreground="{StaticResource Hunsu.Text}"
                     FontSize="{StaticResource Hunsu.FontSmall}" />
        </StackPanel>
        <Border.ContextMenu>
          <ContextMenu>
            <MenuItem x:Name="MenuToggleAll" Header="패널 모두 접기" Click="MenuToggleAll_Click" />
            <MenuItem Header="부르기 · 닫기" InputGestureText="Ctrl+Alt+H" Click="MenuSummon_Click" />
            <MenuItem Header="전부 숨기기" InputGestureText="Ctrl+Alt+Shift+H" Click="MenuHideAll_Click" />
            <MenuItem Header="모듈 관리…" Click="MenuManager_Click" />
            <Separator />
            <MenuItem Header="훈수꾼 끄기" Click="MenuQuit_Click" />
          </ContextMenu>
        </Border.ContextMenu>
      </Border>
      <StackPanel x:Name="Items" />
    </StackPanel>
  </Grid>
</Window>
